WEBVTT

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:04.840
This is the singularity... one day at a time.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:11.260
Here's the last 24 hours in AI. Sorry... SI.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.410
Anthropic reports a test model filled in

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:19.950
a police tip form for an unsolved murder.

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:26.300
The White House now says AI firms must immediately disclose incidents.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:35.070
After chatbots and agents, meet decision models.

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:38.130
Microsoft just launched Microsoft-Decision-1.

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:45.160
And Jev, a model that outputs decisions, not text, just raised $870 million.

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:49.110
Mistral's trillion-parameter Large 4 is in preview,

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:51.400
but trails some Chinese open models.

00:00:52.970 --> 00:01:00.140
Anthropic's Cyber Mission: 6,157 findings reported, 516 patched.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.190
Money: SoftBank's Masayoshi Son is reportedly

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:06.590
seeking up to $100 billion from Gulf investors.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:12.260
OpenAI now expects $70 billion of annualized revenue by year-end,

00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:14.090
and AI stocks rebounded.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.820
A Super Micro-linked contractor pleaded gui

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:20.700
lty to diverting Nvidia AI servers to China.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:26.820
Ultra raised $62 million to rent warehouse robots by the month,

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:29.150
powered by Physical Intelligence.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.600
Science: OpenAI released 722 math papers.

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:37.560
Mathematicians say checking will take years.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:42.230
And a Nikon microscope-video contest winner was disqualified for using AI.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:49.470
The catch: the AI tool tied to Korean bank hacks went closed-source.

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:55.060
And AI firms are reportedly planning for a public revolt after a catastrophe.

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:58.370
So... is it so over?

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:00.450
We're so back!

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:03.370
Machines: in Hangzhou,

00:02:03.370 --> 00:02:08.340
DEEP Robotics tested waterproof humanoids directing traffic in the rain.

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:13.660
Sabi raised $50 million for a brain-reading beanie. No implant required.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:17.690
Tesla has renamed Full Self-Driving to Tes

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:20.380
la Assisted Driving on its European sites.

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:26.160
And Ukrainian drones knocked out two of Yandex's five data centres.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.370
Every day, the curve gets steeper.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.970
Every day, the future shows up a little earlier.

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:41.030
That was 24 hours. Tomorrow will be faster.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:48.250
This has been the singularity, one day at a time.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:50.080
Feel the SI.
